        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 6544 Classic Mortise Hamilton Handleset with 5152 Drop Tail Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe classic arched edges of the Hamilton 6544 Single Cylinder Handleset makes it ideal for traditional homes. It will fit 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\". It is available with a single cylinder or a dummy function.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMortise locks have been, and still are, the established norm for Europe and much of the rest of the world. In the early 1960’s Baldwin brought residential mortise locks to America. They ‘founded’ the residential mortise industry and continue to be the leader – so much so that their competitors have bought Baldwin locks for their own homes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional 6544 Hamilton Door Entrance Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty steel mortise lock body for a lifetime of trouble-free operation.  </li>\r\n<li>Mortise locks have adjustable forged brass lock fronts, protected by armored scalp fronts for ultimate strength and protection against tampering.</li>\r\n<li>Forged brass and steel mechanical.</li>\r\n<li>Locks and strikes fit standard ANSI A115.1 preparation.</li>\r\n<li>Reinforced steel security strike with three inch screws.</li>\r\n<li>Anti friction latch bolt with 3/4” throw.  </li>\r\n<li>1” throw deadbolt has two hardened steel inserts for maximum protection and security.</li>\r\n<li>7mm hub broached on the diamond</li>\r\n<li>Accessibility Code (ADA) A117.1</li>\r\n<li>Certified by Underwriters Laboratories (UL) for use on fire doors up to three-hour rating.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Limited Warranty</b> on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Estates Collection Hamilton Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: 5152 Lever</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Length: 17\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 3.4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Thickness: .8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 7\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Overall Exterior Projection: 2.9\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Length: 10.8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 3.4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Thickness: .8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Length: 3.9\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Interior Projection: 2.9\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Hub to Turn Piece Length: 2.25\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Hub to Cylinder Length: 3.437\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset:  2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-6544.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Hamilton Handleset Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-estate_mortise_dimensions.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Mortise Box Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a key unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
